  "description": "Depression filling (priority-flood), D8 flow directions, and drainage accumulation over a DEM.",
  "display_name": "Terrain Flow",
  "gpu": false,
  "id": "rs:terrain_flow",
  "input": "raster",
  "notes": "Priority-flood filling (NoData cells are barriers, never routed across); D8 codes are the ESRI powers of two with 0 = sink; accumulation counts include the cell itself. Full-frame kernel contract (O(N log N)).",
